        "original_id": "c0de601f-0131-5b0f-a07d-65a5557dd6d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Gugino, Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje\n- Organizations: Warner Bros.\n- Products: Son in Law, Sin City, Night at the Museum, Mr. Popper's Penguins, San Andreas, The Space Between Us, Gerald's Game, Faster\n- Systems: DC Extended Universe\n- Concepts: American actress, media franchise, shared universe\n\nFacts:\n- Carla Gugino was born on August 29, 1971, and she is an American actress.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Son in Law in 1993.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Sin City in 2005.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Night at the Museum in 2006.\n- Faster, a 2010 film, also features Carla Gugino, Tom Berenger, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, and Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Mr. Popper's Penguins in 2011.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film San Andreas in 2015.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature films The Space Between Us and Gerald's Game in 2017.\n- Carla Gugino played Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\n- The DC Extended Universe is the unofficial name of the Justice League Universe and is an American media franchise and shared universe centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
